# The Heritage assignment spelling (spec/grammar.md#ebnf-notation make-assignment ::= "make" word-literal
# expression; spec/conformance.md#feature-to-profile-table — an alternate spelling only, no new semantics). `make`
# binds `count` exactly as `set count to 7`/`:count = 7` would, so the later `:count` read returns
# the value it stored (mutate nearest binding, else create global — spec/execution-model.md#variables-scoping-and-procedures).
make "count" 7
print :count
